# Quartus resaves its own project files with Windows line endings (CRLF)
# every time it opens/compiles the project, regardless of host OS. Without
# this, every local Quartus save shows up as a full-file diff and blocks
# `git pull` with a "local changes would be overwritten" conflict even
# though nothing meaningful changed. Force these to CRLF so git normalizes
# storage but always checks out/compares CRLF, matching what Quartus writes.
*.qsf text eol=crlf
*.qpf text eol=crlf
*.sdc text eol=crlf
*.qws text eol=crlf
